^["stream"]{
 >>[2026-08-24 13:48] observe — the repository requests Java 21 but the machine exposes only Java 13; one ignored local Gradle override points at an uninstalled Homebrew JDK path.
 >>[2026-08-24 13:49] observe — the plugin builds against IntelliJ IDEA Ultimate 2024.2.1 while its description claims WebStorm 2026.2 optimization and its metadata extends through the unverified 263 branch.
 >>[2026-08-24 13:50] observe — official platform guidance requires Gradle 9 for the current 2.18.1 build plugin, recommends compiling against the lowest supported host, and requires Plugin Verifier evidence for the declared range.
 >>[2026-08-24 13:51] decide — use Java 21, stable Kotlin 2.4.10, Gradle 9.5, IntelliJ Platform Gradle Plugin 2.18.1, WebStorm 2024.2.1 as the compile floor, and 262.* as the declared ceiling.
 >>[2026-08-24 13:52] decide — keep the native JetBrains LSP adapter; complete mounted-workbench discovery without activating the speculative LSP4IJ migration.
 >>[2026-08-24 13:53] taste — compatibility copy should name built, verified, and declared coordinates separately; adjectives may not substitute for receipts.
}

